** regression test: large-slip pull-out of a bar tilted by 45 degrees to the structured mesh, through its nodes;
** pulled 30 mm along the bar (the same response as the aligned bar, EmbeddedBondPullOutLargeSlip2D)
** 2D pull-out of a bar tilted by 45 degrees to the structured mesh: concrete block 200 x 200 (CPE8R 20 x 20,
** thickness 150), Ø16 bar along y = x - 30 -- through the mesh nodes -- bonded length 120 mm, free length 20 mm, exiting
** through the loaded face x = 200, which bears on a plate; the bar is pulled along its axis; units N, mm
** the free length is one bar element: a truss has no transverse stiffness without tension, so free interior
** nodes would be a mechanism at the start
